He really thinks he can play it off.

66
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:40,880
Your arrogance will only lead to
your Davy - uh, lead to your defeat!

67
00:03:43,480 --> 00:03:44,310
What?

68
00:03:44,540 --> 00:03:45,897
