Hidden flail.

71
00:04:01,940 --> 00:04:03,380
66 now!

72
00:04:22,320 --> 00:04:25,740
I've learned something
in these past two years.

73
00:04:27,080 --> 00:04:33,120
I've come to an understanding about the
true nature of the revive, revive fruit.

74
00:04:38,520 --> 00:04:40,057
When most people die,

75
