with a presence that is palpable.

80
00:04:59,620 --> 00:05:03,032
That soul resonates through
the strings of my instruments.

81
00:05:03,720 --> 00:05:06,740
Rock and roll, screaming
from another dimension.

82
00:05:08,300 --> 00:05:09,577
Mesmerized by its melodies.

83
00:05:09,660 --> 00:05:13,057
The listeners dance their
way into a land of illusions.

84
00:05:13,140 --> 00:05:16,657
But when my soul flutters
away from this old body?

85
00:05:16,740 --> 00:05:18,957
It is no mere apparition!

86
00:05:19,040 --> 00:05:22,880
It can be seen as surely
as my rattling bones.

87
00:05:30,300 --> 00:05:31,717
I did it!

88
00:05:31,800 --> 00:05:34,600
POPPED HIS HEAD RIGHT OFF HIS BODY NECK!

89
00:05:34,760 --> 00:05:36,600
