organs that bind me to this world.

93
00:05:50,380 --> 00:05:53,204
So what is it that gives
me life, you might ask?

94
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:56,220
IT'S MY SOOOOOOOM!

95
00:06:04,980 --> 00:06:07,980
