242
00:17:31,480 --> 00:17:35,640
The humans are fighting against
the new fishman pirates, for us.

243
00:17:42,360 --> 00:17:46,597
What about that guy is
he human their crew is

244
00:17:46,680 --> 00:17:49,557
a bit strange but the
important thing is what

245
00:17:49,640 --> 00:17:53,057
They're doing you must
see things for yourself

246
00:17:53,140 --> 00:17:56,000
that's the only way to
understand the truth

247
00:17:57,580 --> 00:18:03,060
No matter what you've heard in the past you
must look at today with an objective eye

248
