The guy knows what he's talking about!

263
00:18:49,700 --> 00:18:50,530
Thank you!

264
00:18:50,613 --> 00:18:52,917
If there's one kind of
person I don't like,

265
00:18:53,000 --> 00:18:55,257
it's someone who doesn't
value the lives of others.

266
00:18:55,340 --> 00:18:57,164
I can't even stand their smell.

267
00:18:57,600 --> 00:18:59,835
And I don't have a nose to smell them!

268
00:19:04,200 --> 00:19:08,318
You and your friends are the ones
who don't value the lives of others.

269
00:19:09,620 --> 00:19:13,397
I bet you all think you're being bold
and selfish by staying here to fight.

270
00:19:13,480 --> 00:19:17,877
But every last one of you humans are
gonna die when the Noah hits the island!

271
00:19:17,960 --> 00:19:21,254
Although I'm still not sure
whether you're human or not.

272
00:19:21,740 --> 00:19:24,157
I can promise you that
one of these days our

273
00:19:24,240 --> 00:19:26,497
Captain Luffy will become
the king of the pirates.

274
00:19:26,580 --> 00:19:29,917
He is a man who keeps his
word no matter the cost.

275
00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:35,080
So if he says that no harm will come to
the people here, then no harm will come.

276
00:19:35,960 --> 00:19:37,897
I believe in him no matter what.

277
00:19:37,980 --> 00:19:40,451
so that ship will never touch this island.

278
00:19:40,800 --> 00:19:44,080
And now it's time for me
to step up and do my part.

279
00:19:45,120 --> 00:19:48,532
That means I won't let you
disappear before my eyes again,

280
00:19:48,700 --> 00:19:51,200
even though I have no eyes to speak of!

281
00:19:56,440 --> 00:19:58,160
Whoa, how about this?

282
00:19:59,560 --> 00:20:00,390
Impressed yet?

283
00:20:00,620 --> 00:20:02,900
Oh, sure, that's pretty damn big.

284
00:20:03,860 --> 00:20:05,057
Yeah, impressive stuff.

285
00:20:05,140 --> 00:20:06,160
Ha, ha, ha!

286
00:20:06,560 --> 00:20:07,400
Not so!

287
00:20:09,700 --> 00:20:13,560
Well then, do you want to
wrap this up now, Jinbei?

288
00:20:14,520 --> 00:20:16,780
Yeah, it's about time!

289
00:20:17,620 --> 00:20:18,450
Huh?

290
00:20:19,560 --> 00:20:21,000
Hey, not fair.

291
00:20:21,380 --> 00:20:23,700
You've destroyed both of my swords.

292
00:20:24,700 --> 00:20:28,400
How could I win a sword
fight if I don't have swords?

293
00:20:29,940 --> 00:20:31,460
Not my problem.

294
00:20:46,260 --> 00:20:48,460
All right, I'm going balls out.

295
00:20:48,680 --> 00:20:52,257
This new special move is going to
take you down in a single shot.

296
00:20:52,340 --> 00:20:58,420
One, two, and on the third step,
it's all over. Think I'm kidding?

297
00:20:58,660 --> 00:20:59,700
Just try me.

298
00:21:00,620 --> 00:21:02,900
What kind of moron do you take me for?

299
00:21:03,620 --> 00:21:05,817
I'm calling you out on your stupid bluff.

300
00:21:05,900 --> 00:21:08,841
You're a weakling and
you'll always be a weakling.

301
00:21:09,240 --> 00:21:12,887
You know, I used to lie about
this kind of stuff all the time.

302
00:21:13,020 --> 00:21:16,432
But now it doesn't really
matter if you believe me or not.

303
00:21:17,500 --> 00:21:19,441
Because I know I'm the real deal.

304
00:21:20,520 --> 00:21:21,350
Holy crap!

305
00:21:21,500 --> 00:21:22,735
What is that monster?

306
00:21:23,000 --> 00:21:23,830
Yeah!

307
00:21:23,980 --> 00:21:25,737
Where did that thing come from?

308
00:21:25,820 --> 00:21:26,940
Whoa, did he?

309
00:21:31,720 --> 00:21:33,080
No, not again!

310
00:21:33,800 --> 00:21:34,630
Huh?

311
00:21:34,920 --> 00:21:36,000
That runt?

312
00:21:36,260 --> 00:21:37,860
How'd he get so big?

313
00:21:38,840 --> 00:21:40,540
Whoa, pal! Easy! Easy!

314
00:21:48,120 --> 00:21:49,920
Calm down, Chopper!

315
00:21:50,020 --> 00:21:52,079
You can't lose control like before!

316
00:21:55,640 --> 00:21:56,470
Huh?

317
00:22:01,380 --> 00:22:02,860
Don't worry, Usopp.

318
00:22:03,160 --> 00:22:04,660
I know what I'm doing.

319
00:22:10,620 --> 00:22:13,267
Chopper, are you sure
you're okay over there?

320
00:22:13,500 --> 00:22:15,980
Oh yeah, I got it all under control.

321
00:22:16,360 --> 00:22:20,137
With just one rumble ball, I can
fight in this form for three minutes.

322
00:22:20,220 --> 00:22:23,514
Plus, I don't pass out at the
end or anything like that.

323
00:22:24,040 --> 00:22:27,100
Now you guys don't have to
look out for me so much.

324
00:22:27,600 --> 00:22:30,737
Don't sell yourself short if
you can do this kind of stuff

325
00:22:30,820 --> 00:22:34,408
whenever you want you're gonna
be the one looking out for us!

326
00:22:36,920 --> 00:22:38,637
Flattery will get you nowhere, buddy.

327
00:22:38,720 --> 00:22:40,080
Doesn't work on me. Ha!

328
00:22:40,500 --> 00:22:41,760
Nope, not at all

329
00:22:43,020 --> 00:22:43,850
That's creepy.

330
00:22:45,960 --> 00:22:47,957
Now you've really made me angry!

331
00:22:48,040 --> 00:22:52,457
I don't care how big you are
all it takes is one good docent.

332
00:22:52,540 --> 00:22:53,893
and you're out of here!

333
00:22:56,100 --> 00:22:57,520
Dosing all you want?

334
00:22:57,960 --> 00:23:00,431
Sorry, but I don't plan on going anywhere.

335
00:23:01,840 --> 00:23:03,520
Now, bring it on!

336
00:23:04,200 --> 00:23:05,060
Nice going.

337
00:23:05,740 --> 00:23:06,570
Yeah!

338
00:23:06,653 --> 00:23:09,757
You think you can just chat it up with
your friend in the middle of a fight?

339
00:23:09,840 --> 00:23:12,557
You're lucky I don't gnaw
straight through you.

340
00:23:12,640 --> 00:23:16,537
I don't know why your Straw Hat pals bother
putting up with dead weight like you.

341
00:23:16,620 --> 00:23:19,738
I'm gonna do my favor and
put you out of your misery.

342
00:23:21,740 --> 00:23:25,817
You're welcome to try but first I
want to show you something cool.

343
00:23:25,900 --> 00:23:30,537
Pay attention you're about to see
a magic trick you'll never forget.

344
00:23:30,620 --> 00:23:35,717
A special move if that's your game
I've got plenty of those myself.

345
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:41,357
Maybe the squid spear didn't
work but I've got another

346
00:23:41,440 --> 00:23:44,557
weapon that'll Don't cut through
anything you can throw at me,

347
00:23:44,640 --> 00:23:45,470
hee!

348
00:23:47,720 --> 00:23:50,720
Say hello to the Lightbrite spear!

349
00:23:52,280 --> 00:23:55,574
It's powerful enough to cut
a hole through your cockpit!

350
00:23:55,800 --> 00:24:00,660
This battle will be over in one
shot, but it'll be won by me, hee!

351
00:24:01,920 --> 00:24:03,567
That does look pretty sweet!

352
00:24:04,360 --> 00:24:09,520
But if I'm being honest, it's still way
less ultimate than my ultimate weapon!

353
00:24:09,840 --> 00:24:11,899
You're squid out of luck now, dude!

354
00:24:14,100 --> 00:24:16,300
What's a swordman without his swords?

355
00:24:16,780 --> 00:24:18,220
What should I do?

356
00:24:19,840 --> 00:24:22,780
You're just going to croak
like a frog. I'm done.

357
00:24:23,100 --> 00:24:24,040
Waste of time.

358
00:24:25,880 --> 00:24:27,500
Wrap this up, you said?

359
00:24:28,180 --> 00:24:29,827
Not till I'm good and ready.

360
00:24:30,480 --> 00:24:34,297
You think I got all puffed up just
to deal with a loser like you?

361
00:24:34,380 --> 00:24:35,210
Quit dreaming!

362
00:24:36,260 --> 00:24:39,237
You know all I got to do is
roll around this plaza a few

363
00:24:39,320 --> 00:24:42,908
times and all your friends will
be smooshed flat as pancakes!

364
00:24:46,200 --> 00:24:50,957
This is my space you washed
up pile of bones take one step

365
00:24:51,040 --> 00:24:55,540
inside this circle and you'll
be dead all over again I promise

366
00:24:57,720 --> 00:24:58,840
your move

367
00:25:13,220 --> 00:25:18,560
I'm terribly sorry, but I've already made
my way inside the circle and cut you.

368
00:25:19,440 --> 00:25:23,440
Also, as a fair warning,
this will be cold.

369
00:25:24,200 --> 00:25:25,840
When did you get in here?

370
00:25:26,380 --> 00:25:28,020
Song of Scratches.

371
00:25:28,380 --> 00:25:29,660
Blizzard Slice.

372
00:25:35,420 --> 00:25:37,300
And now, a haiku.

373
00:25:38,320 --> 00:25:42,380
A blood-chilling wind howls
from the land of the dead

374
00:25:48,240 --> 00:25:49,070
Gotcha!

375
00:25:53,660 --> 00:25:54,490
Ah!

376
00:25:54,800 --> 00:25:55,800
What is this?

377
00:25:56,140 --> 00:25:59,020
My queen star, human drake technique?

378
00:26:00,540 --> 00:26:03,217
Those plants have arms
and leg-shaped roots that

379
00:26:03,300 --> 00:26:06,065
attack and latch onto
whatever flies over them!

380
00:26:06,560 --> 00:26:07,920
Good luck with that.

381
00:26:10,380 --> 00:26:11,400
Now what?

382
00:26:13,240 --> 00:26:15,040
Green Star Trampolia.

383
00:26:15,360 --> 00:26:17,780
It's pretty self-explanatory. Anyway,

384
00:26:18,060 --> 00:26:20,257
now that you've been
catapulted into the sky,

385
00:26:20,340 --> 00:26:22,577
there's not much you can
do to defend yourself.

386
00:26:22,660 --> 00:26:24,700
Here goes Green Star.

387
00:26:32,440 --> 00:26:34,577
I don't care about you, dumb dog.

388
00:26:34,660 --> 00:26:36,657
I'll rip it to shreds.

389
00:26:36,740 --> 00:26:37,880
I wouldn't.

390
00:26:38,060 --> 00:26:40,080
See that red bulb on its nose?

391
00:26:40,380 --> 00:26:44,817
If you attack, that thing will release a
devastating shockwave three meters wide.

392
00:26:44,900 --> 00:26:45,920
Like this.

393
00:26:51,740 --> 00:26:52,570
That's what?

394
00:26:52,653 --> 00:26:53,483
Awesome, right?

395
00:26:54,140 --> 00:26:54,970
Dosan!

396
00:26:55,280 --> 00:26:56,110
Glamsan!

397
00:26:56,640 --> 00:26:57,470
Slamsan!

398
00:26:57,900 --> 00:27:02,680
Better watch out or you'll get hit by
the dosanest dosan that ever dosered!

399
00:27:03,580 --> 00:27:04,960
Popper a hammer!

400
00:27:06,440 --> 00:27:07,820
It's mine!

401
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,580
It's our fault!

402
00:27:17,120 --> 00:27:18,640
It's roguesome.

403
00:27:19,740 --> 00:27:21,080
Eka, eka, eka!

404
00:27:21,500 --> 00:27:22,420
Too bad.

405
00:27:22,740 --> 00:27:25,180
You won't make dried squid out of me!

406
00:27:26,400 --> 00:27:27,230
Franky!

407
00:27:28,200 --> 00:27:29,840
Eka, eka, eka!

408
00:27:30,420 --> 00:27:31,540
Radical me!

409
00:27:41,620 --> 00:27:44,080
It's got a laser beam too.

410
00:27:50,960 --> 00:27:53,620
And be gone!

411
00:28:03,700 --> 00:28:04,530
Oh my!

412
00:28:04,613 --> 00:28:06,060
Did he just bring a leak?

413
00:28:06,520 --> 00:28:08,696
All these ears are going to come out!

414
00:28:12,920 --> 00:28:14,160
Enjoy the view.

415
00:28:14,460 --> 00:28:15,460
It's your last.

416
00:28:16,060 --> 00:28:17,800
Please, you know how to fly!

417
00:28:18,220 --> 00:28:20,400
You scared the guts out of me!

418
00:28:21,520 --> 00:28:24,980
The last two years were
a stain upon my soul.

419
00:28:26,300 --> 00:28:27,500
Oh, Sanji!

420
00:28:28,160 --> 00:28:29,760
I went through hell!

421
00:28:30,180 --> 00:28:31,620
It isn't fair!

422
00:28:32,680 --> 00:28:34,060
He got my ass!

423
00:28:34,300 --> 00:28:36,600
I want to burn those days to ashes!

424
00:28:37,280 --> 00:28:38,360
Hell, memory!

425
00:28:43,780 --> 00:28:45,368
Scared the guts out of you?

426
00:28:45,500 --> 00:28:47,500
Good, that'll make the job easier.

427
00:28:48,980 --> 00:28:50,392
Blowfish guts are toxic.

428
00:28:50,740 --> 00:28:52,564
You have to take that part out.

429
00:28:54,380 --> 00:28:56,260
Let's see you block this!

430
00:28:57,340 --> 00:28:58,400
Quit it, Frog.

431
00:28:58,740 --> 00:28:59,620
This is over.

432
00:28:59,840 --> 00:29:01,660
I told you I'm not a frog!

433
00:29:02,920 --> 00:29:05,437
I'm the Master Swordsman Yasuie,

434
00:29:05,520 --> 00:29:09,240
Fishman Islands Champion of
the Octopus Eight-Sword Style!

435
00:29:09,840 --> 00:29:10,800
Curgatory!

436
00:29:12,240 --> 00:29:13,200
PUNIGINI!

437
00:29:16,660 --> 00:29:17,500
My mistake.

438
00:29:17,980 --> 00:29:20,300
Maybe you're not a frog after all.

439
00:29:20,620 --> 00:29:22,100
But you did broke.
